WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:32.320 --> 00:35.240
Ah, Woojae, right there, just a little more...

3
00:55.850 --> 01:00.100
Come deeper, you're driving me crazy.

4
01:09.240 --> 01:13.820
Go Taewoon, Kim Dohyun

5
01:25.710 --> 01:30.340
Baek Seunghoon, Lee Kyungwon

6
01:41.350 --> 01:49.280
Twisted Tie

7
01:49.280 --> 01:52.570
Episode 4. Twisted Triangle

8
02:59.510 --> 03:03.060
Are you alright? Are you uncomfortable anywhere?

9
03:03.060 --> 03:08.100
Are you alright? Are you uncomfortable anywhere?

10
03:10.320 --> 03:13.900
Stop. I've lost interest.

11
03:17.410 --> 03:19.910
Did I do something wrong?

12
03:22.950 --> 03:24.790
No...

13
03:26.250 --> 03:28.540
You're always perfect.

14
03:29.790 --> 03:32.300
That's why it's boring, today.

15
03:42.100 --> 03:44.520
Go clean up and leave.

16
03:44.520 --> 03:46.560
I want to be alone today.

17
04:09.790 --> 04:13.800
It's about time he answered his phone.

18
04:39.200 --> 04:43.990
[Matchbox, Mr. Baek]

19
05:04.890 --> 05:09.140
- Team Leader Kang. - Yes, Mr. Baek.

20
05:09.140 --> 05:13.190
Were you sleeping? You sound quite drowsy.

21
05:13.190 --> 05:17.440
So, have you given some thought to the offer I made earlier today?

22
05:17.440 --> 05:25.580
I believe I told you. I have no intention of sending my employee to such a private setting.

23
05:25.580 --> 05:30.580
- We can discuss the contract again tomorrow morning... - Come on, Team Leader Kang.

24
05:30.580 --> 05:33.960
Let's not drag this out.

25
05:33.960 --> 05:41.470
If you want to see my stamp on that contract, send Lee Sunwoo to my hotel room tomorrow.

26
05:44.970 --> 05:50.930
If you just send him, I might send him back without laying a finger on him,

27
05:50.930 --> 05:53.440
or maybe not.

28
05:59.570 --> 06:02.490
Make your decision and let me know by tomorrow.

29
06:26.430 --> 06:30.600
Mr. Kang, are you alright?

30
06:30.600 --> 06:34.730
Did something happen at work?

31
06:34.730 --> 06:38.650
I thought I heard my name earlier.

32
06:54.580 --> 06:56.710
Mr. Kang.

33
07:02.880 --> 07:05.510
[Matchbox, Mr. Baek] Veri Hotel Suite 1502, Tomorrow 9 PM

34
07:13.430 --> 07:17.270
Veri Hotel Suite 1502, Tomorrow 9 PM

35
07:17.560 --> 07:21.480
Tomorrow night, go to that hotel.

36
07:21.480 --> 07:25.700
The final condition for this contract... is you.

37
07:25.700 --> 07:27.280
What?

38
07:27.280 --> 07:30.620
Go and humor him just until he signs it.

39
07:30.620 --> 07:37.750
Put personal feelings aside. This is a work order from your team leader.

40
07:41.420 --> 07:44.920
Mr. Kang, you're joking right now, right?

41
07:44.920 --> 07:49.720
You saw the way that Mr. Baek was looking at me, Mr. Kang.

42
07:51.640 --> 07:56.180
And yet, you want me to walk in there on my own two feet?

43
07:59.020 --> 08:02.270
Are you testing me or something?

44
08:02.270 --> 08:05.690
I'm not joking.

45
08:05.690 --> 08:08.570
Separate your personal and professional life.

46
08:20.750 --> 08:24.380
Separate... personal and professional.

47
08:26.300 --> 08:33.470
Right. I'm a company employee too, and a newbie who jumps when Mr. Kang says jump.

48
08:42.150 --> 08:44.690
However, Mr. Kang.

49
08:44.690 --> 08:49.900
How far exactly does this 'work order' extend?

50
08:51.320 --> 08:53.910
You told me to humor him.

51
08:53.910 --> 08:56.990
- Mr. Lee. - Do I just need to pour him drinks?

52
08:56.990 --> 09:02.040
Or do we wash up together, and I lie in his bed,

53
09:02.040 --> 09:08.800
and beg him to touch me and adore me with my own mouth before he gives us his damn stamp?

54
09:08.800 --> 09:15.850
- Mr. Lee, don't cross the line. - You were the one... who crossed the line first, Mr. Kang.

55
09:25.900 --> 09:31.860
You were the one who grabbed my tie and shook me with that defenseless look, Mr. Kang.

56
09:33.110 --> 09:38.080
And after making me go crazy for you like this,

57
09:38.080 --> 09:43.540
now you're telling me to go wag my tail for another man?

58
09:46.130 --> 09:48.420
How...

59
09:49.170 --> 09:51.720
How could you do this to me?

60
09:51.720 --> 09:55.340
To me, you're my whole world, Mr. Kang...

61
09:56.390 --> 10:05.310
To you, Mr. Kang, was I just some toy you could throw into someone else's bed whenever you wanted?

62
10:20.240 --> 10:29.090
I'll go tomorrow. I'll walk into that hotel you ordered me to go to.

63
10:31.840 --> 10:34.340
This is truly miserable.

64
10:43.770 --> 10:46.560
I'll be on my way.

65
10:46.560 --> 10:54.780
Tomorrow night, I'll spread my legs like you ordered and make sure to get that stamp...

66
10:54.780 --> 10:58.070
But you must promise me this one thing in return.

67
10:59.870 --> 11:11.340
Promise me that while I'm gasping in his arms, you'll be right here, feeling just as horrified and miserable as I am, Mr. Kang.

68
12:42.640 --> 12:47.020
[Mr. Lee] I'm heading out now.

69
12:50.810 --> 12:54.110
[Mr. Lee] I'm heading out now.

70
13:54.630 --> 13:58.090
What brings you here, Mr. Kang?

71
13:59.550 --> 14:03.880
You were the one who pushed me to go, Mr. Kang.

72
14:13.020 --> 14:17.690
What else, the contract...

73
14:19.440 --> 14:23.950
Right, I came to confirm that the important contract is proceeding properly.

74
14:25.450 --> 14:30.540
I was worried you'd act like an idiot again and get on Mr. Baek's bad side.

75
14:30.540 --> 14:34.460
I came to supervise you as your team leader.

76
14:45.180 --> 14:47.260
But...

77
14:52.390 --> 14:56.520
What is with your clothes when your superior is here?

78
14:59.690 --> 15:04.030
Did I teach you to stay so sloppily unbuttoned like this?

79
15:19.630 --> 15:25.340
Did that bastard... already touch you?

80
15:25.340 --> 15:28.840
Where? Answer me.

81
15:30.010 --> 15:34.270
Where, where did he touch you? Your lips?

82
15:36.020 --> 15:40.400
Your waist? Or further?

83
15:42.570 --> 15:48.450
Why are you acting like this? Didn't you send me here fully prepared for this?

84
15:50.240 --> 15:55.000
Prepared? Ha...

85
15:56.290 --> 15:58.670
Prepared...

86
16:06.050 --> 16:09.800
Yeah, I told you to go.

87
16:11.010 --> 16:19.730
Spouting nonsense about separating personal and professional life, acting all cool... I... I threw you in here with my own hands.

88
16:23.400 --> 16:25.690
But fuck...

89
16:32.910 --> 16:35.200
I was out of my mind.

90
16:37.710 --> 16:40.370
I was completely insane.

91
16:40.370 --> 16:44.420
It hasn't even been a minute, but... I can't breathe.

92
16:45.300 --> 16:48.300
I feel like I'm going crazy.

93
16:50.680 --> 16:53.600
How could I be prepared for this!

94
17:00.020 --> 17:03.400
I hate that bastard even looking at you...

95
17:04.480 --> 17:12.410
And it's even more horrifying that you'd smile at him with that sweet face of yours.

96
17:12.410 --> 17:16.290
I really feel like I'm going to die.

97
17:28.550 --> 17:31.220
Don't...

98
17:32.800 --> 17:35.300
Please don't, Sunwoo.

99
17:35.300 --> 17:37.850
It's all my fault.

100
17:37.850 --> 17:46.320
I'm a son of a bitch and a stupid piece of trash. I don't care about being a team leader or the contract...

101
17:48.650 --> 17:51.360
Please...

102
17:51.360 --> 17:58.660
Don't show that sweet face of yours to any bastard other than me.

103
18:05.630 --> 18:08.840
Don't abandon me, please.

104
18:20.430 --> 18:22.680
What is this, Team Leader Kang?

105
18:26.230 --> 18:29.360
Are you a voyeur or something?

106
18:29.360 --> 18:34.240
Coming into someone else's hotel room without permission, are you here to watch?

107
18:37.240 --> 18:41.160
Mr. Baek, this is...

108
18:41.160 --> 18:46.830
Mr. Lee, it seems your master got worried and chased you all the way here.

109
18:46.830 --> 18:50.710
What will you do? Do you want to go back?

110
18:51.840 --> 18:53.970
No.

111
18:53.970 --> 18:58.100
Mr. Kang told me to separate my personal and professional life.

112
18:58.680 --> 19:03.430
I'm here to follow his work orders.

113
19:06.900 --> 19:09.400
Did you hear that? Team Leader Kang.

114
19:10.980 --> 19:14.990
So either watch, or get out.

115
19:14.990 --> 19:17.240
Suit yourself.

116
19:36.630 --> 19:38.640
Don't.

117
19:40.260 --> 19:42.390
Don't...

118
19:43.770 --> 19:47.350
Don't touch what's mine, fu...

119
19:54.110 --> 19:57.030
You couldn't hold back after all.

120
19:58.570 --> 20:01.120
Right, Team Leader Kang.

121
20:01.120 --> 20:05.330
Even you can't bear to let someone else steal something this delicious, right?

122
20:21.090 --> 20:27.890
If you feel wronged, why don't you tie him up yourself? It's too much of a waste for only you to know Mr. Lee's body, isn't it?

123
21:46.220 --> 21:52.440
Twisted Tie
